### Page 6 of 13

```text
Peaches’ Package Liquor and Barr LLC
Dallas Tyrrell
1210 Jessi Drive
Cheyenne, Wy
January 24th 2022
Dear Mayor Collins and City Council Members,
Thank you for your time and consideration for my application to add a liquor
store and bar to our community. My name is Dallas Tyrrell, a lifelong Laramie
County resident with a passion to make our community a better place.
My vision for this new business would be a gathering place for community
fundraisers, events and just ultimately a place anyone can meet for a good time.
Located in an easily accessible location to all people within the city and county.
There are currently no licenses that sell liquor open to the public with 1 mile in
any direction of this proposed location; thus meeting a long desired need of our
citizens living in our community. Also with the location being so close to a Wal
Mart it will be easily accessed.
```

### Page 7 of 13

```text
The site currently meets zoning requirements to hold this business. This store
being built would help diversify the other properties around this location. Also
please note this location is NOT located within 500 feet of a hospital, church,
school or daycare facility.
Once this application is approved I believe the liquor store can and will be open
for business approximately 25 months after the approval.
I have attached my
plans for the building proposed.
Again, thank you for your time and consideration and
I ask that you please
approve my application.
Sincerely,
Dallas W. Tyrrell, Owner
```

