January 28, 2022
To Whom It May Concern:
The purpose of this letter is to set forth some of the basic terms and conditions of the proposed
purchase by Peaches’ Package Liquor and Bar LLC. of certain real estate owned by Goodwill
Industries of Wyoming, Inc. The terms set forth in this letter will not become binding until a
more detailed “Purchase Agreement” is negotiated and signed by the parties.
The property proposed to be sold is located at Converse Avenue and Mason Way and is legally
described as: Anderson Corner, 3rd filing: Lot 2, Block 1, Cheyenne WY.
The purchase is contingent on approval of application.
Buyer is providing a Pre-qualification
letter with this letter of intent.
All other terms and conditions will also be negotiated and signed in a more detailed “Purchase
Agreement.”
